# Ignore all font directories except those committed to the repo.
# Fonts like NotoSansCJK are downloaded on demand by build-sd-fonts.py.
*
!.gitignore
!NotoSerif/
!NotoSerif/**
!NotoSans/
!NotoSans/**
!NotoSansArabic/
!NotoSansArabic/**
!NotoSansHebrew/
!NotoSansHebrew/**
!OpenDyslexic/
!OpenDyslexic/**
!Ubuntu/
!Ubuntu/**
# Pinned kimchi sources and their copyright/provenance, not download caches.
!KoPub-Batang/
!KoPub-Batang/KoPub Batang Light.ttf
!Pretendard/
!Pretendard/Pretendard-Regular.ttf
!Pretendard/OFL.txt
!KOREAN-FONTS.md
!korean-font-sources.json
